{"name": "Bergfried", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/7605cee9001b3aec62f2d52e28cc9da7.poster.avif?t=1785393610\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/7605cee9001b3aec62f2d52e28cc9da7.webm?t=1785393610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/7605cee9001b3aec62f2d52e28cc9da7.mp4?t=1785393610\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bergfried is a strategy game set in a colorful, believable medieval world, where you build and defend unique, organic castles.<br/>Prepare layered defenses and command your troops to withstand enemy attacks. Expand strategically and manage your resources carefully to survive prolonged sieges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"108\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/2b14c011b9f1cd8f09b125ef4982f0bd.avif?t=1785393610\" width=\"780\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/da152bae4984b21e030890aa4ce1f246.poster.avif?t=1785393610\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/da152bae4984b21e030890aa4ce1f246.webm?t=1785393610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/da152bae4984b21e030890aa4ce1f246.mp4?t=1785393610\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bergfried offers an organic castle-building experience on a unique grid that captures the irregular shapes of European castles from the high and late middle ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/4da95d6a362712cac3872b23fc528ba5.poster.avif?t=1785393610\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/4da95d6a362712cac3872b23fc528ba5.webm?t=1785393610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/4da95d6a362712cac3872b23fc528ba5.mp4?t=1785393610\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Build castles that follow the contours of the landscape, taking full advantage of natural defenses or impose strict geometric layouts to fortify your domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plan your defenses carefully to withstand attacking armies and long sieges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place towers and gatehouses, and position troops on the ramparts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"108\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/ae7d2945bba7a029c4cca68adff13734.avif?t=1785393610\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/459d4ef6f2eebd06e94a3a9e9f268f64.poster.avif?t=1785393610\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/459d4ef6f2eebd06e94a3a9e9f268f64.webm?t=1785393610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/459d4ef6f2eebd06e94a3a9e9f268f64.mp4?t=1785393610\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources and manage your economy to construct castles, villages and towns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your territory to gain control of key resources and strengthen your position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt to dynamic events like the market day, tournaments or the king visiting your castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"108\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/d3036ded954f08c4f5f4577683bd5ffe.avif?t=1785393610\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"328\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/b25c50b8191252aa50155f3d9028c8d9.poster.avif?t=1785393610\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/b25c50b8191252aa50155f3d9028c8d9.webm?t=1785393610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/extras/b25c50b8191252aa50155f3d9028c8d9.mp4?t=1785393610\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command your troops in tactical field battles and intense castle sieges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit archers, crossbowmen, spearmen, men-at-arms, and knights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the tactical pause feature to issue commands without time pressure.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Build realistic medieval castles and defend them against rival knights. Bergfried is a strategy game featuring organic castle building and tactical siege battles. Manage your lands, plan your defenses and lead your troops to victory!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3247960/6c750cfe5f234aaee21f29183c2bc17b514959ec/header.jpg?t=1785393610", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Simulation", "Strategy", "City Builder", "Colony Sim", "RTS"], "developers": "Quid Pro Games", "publishers": "Quid Pro Games", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3247960", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "7 June 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0B41bDSBqGY", "first_seen": 1780790400.0}